      "pick": "latest",
      "note": "Every backlight follows the console light knob turned last, pilot's or RIO's. The module has no seat signal, so the knob in the player's hand is the one that moved; in multiplayer either crew member takes it back by turning theirs. Until one moves, the brighter one lights the panels."
